+  'sdata.gvyoj.description': 'Training for Khadi artisans, and machinery, tools or a tool kit for the trained ones to start or grow work such as agarbatti making, pottery, leather footwear, beekeeping, wood craft, handmade paper, food processing, and trades like electrician, plumber and tea vending.',
