+  'sdata.pmjjby.description': 'Life insurance for one year at a time, renewed every year. If you are 18 to 50 years old and have a bank or post office account, you can join. You pay Rs.436 a year, taken from your account. If you die for any reason, your nominee gets Rs.2 lakh.',
