+
+  'sdata.nps_tsep.description': 'A pension for small traders and self-employed people. If you are 18 to 40 years old and your yearly turnover is not above Rs.1.5 crore, you pay Rs.55 to Rs.200 a month, depending on your age when joining, until you reach 60, and the government adds an equal amount each month. You then get a monthly pension of Rs.3,000.',
